 access to the terrace opens up to the garden and creates a calm, green living atmosphere. The apartment also includes a separate bedroom, a fully equipped kitchen and a modern bathroom.\n\nA spiral staircase leads to the souterrain level, which serves as an extension of the living space and can be used as a home office, guest area or hobby room. Following on from this, there is an additional room complemented by additional storage space. \n\nThe apartment has been recently renovated; kitchen, bathroom, flooring and furniture are new and carefully coordinated. It is fully furnished and ready to move in.\n\nThe rental is fixed-term and particularly suitable for families or professionals who like the option of working from home.\n\nLocated in a quiet, green residential area in Berlin-Lichtenrade with good access to public transport, shopping facilities and the airport.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"other"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"83"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"